<title>SRI LANKA: Merchant Bank shares slide 4.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Merchant Bank shares slide 4.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchant Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd fell 4.6 percent, or one rupee, to 20.75 rupees, on a round of profit taking by retail investors, brokers said.</p>
<p>There was early turnover of 8,000 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a lot of profit that can be taken since the scrip rose from about 17 rupees 10 days ago,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The share is a retail favourite due to its high level of liquidity and cheap price, he said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
